Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["01. GRAPE Foundations and Single-Spin Rotations", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"bbf9030f-b3d2-fc4f-ba55-f11dcc7b9c20"],

Cell["\<\
From single-spin state inversion to universal SU(2) gates, Bloch \
trajectories, and interactive parameter trade-offs.\
\>", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"6fdbd356-f0fb-8c4e-82ad-5a063c169a34"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["0. Setup and Loading SpinDynamica", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1fc7fd90-4b10-b543-9b93-81544b03e802"],

Cell["\<\
Add the SpinDynamica package directory to $Path by searching upward from the \
notebook directory and load SpinDynamica`. All five OptimalControl` \
subpackages load automatically. Reuses \
Examples/OptimalControl/Tutorials/Tutorial01_SingleSpinInversion.wls and \
Tutorial02_Universal90Rotation.wls (Manual Chapters 1, 3, 14).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3f36b418-3967-6a41-a1c3-492ec9c71465"],

